            "CMR10"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            9.96
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "prove that the local structure of a Plancherel typical partition converges to a de-",
          "bbox": [
            126.72,
            630.42,
            485.41,
            640.38
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "CMR10"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            9.96
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "terminantal point process with the discrete sine kernel; see Theorem 3. This result",
          "bbox": [
